    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based tactical RPG where victory comes from outscoring, not eliminating your enemies. Four friends are whisked off to a fantasy realm where they must take on teams from local towns to try and find a way home.\u00a0<strong>Build your ultimate team, master 64 abilities, and conquer 16 diverse battlefields in tactical combat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/2d7c6c11bbf75b8f54087838d5272ec6.poster.avif?t=1755449885\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/2d7c6c11bbf75b8f54087838d5272ec6.webm?t=1755449885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/2d7c6c11bbf75b8f54087838d5272ec6.mp4?t=1755449885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4 turn-based tactical football matches with deep strategic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player <strong>Adventure Mode</strong>\u00a0with level up/stat growth, ability unlocking and story progression mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend near or far in Local and Remote Play Together\u00a0<strong>PVP</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal damage to opponents to force <i><strong>SUPER FUMBLES</strong></i> that fly across the field, or <i><strong>WALLOP</strong></i> them to take them out of the game for a spell!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach your team <strong>64 powerful  abilities</strong> as you quest across <strong>16 diverse playfields</strong> in the Queendom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team from\u00a0<strong>8 distinct Positions</strong>\u00a0(similar to classes or jobs in traditional RPGs).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you make a decision that's not turning out so well? No sweat! The built-in <strong>Rewind</strong>\u00a0and <strong>Undo Move</strong> features lets you try again easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playfield is lovingly handcrafted with a 1990's <strong>low-poly aesthetic</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/ca61dfdde82d0e93da0970ef246d60ed.poster.avif?t=1755449885\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/ca61dfdde82d0e93da0970ef246d60ed.webm?t=1755449885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/ca61dfdde82d0e93da0970ef246d60ed.mp4?t=1755449885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drafting Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All units can Move, Tackle and Pitch the ball, but the real strategy comes from their distinct Position abilities. You can build any combination of players from the following 8 Positions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balancer</strong>: Healing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrower</strong>: Forward Passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Striker</strong>: Fast Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caster</strong>: Ranged Magic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blocker</strong>: Tank and Disrupt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defender</strong>: Strong Tackles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supporter</strong>: Team Buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamebreaker</strong>: Wild Card</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/86e0edc55bbe8a404a0e3e3d3fc8c6f9.poster.avif?t=1755449885\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/86e0edc55bbe8a404a0e3e3d3fc8c6f9.webm?t=1755449885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035460/extras/86e0edc55bbe8a404a0e3e3d3fc8c6f9.mp4?t=1755449885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
